  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A simple pendulum of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> and length <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L\"></span> oscillates with frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span>. What is the frequency of oscillation of a simple pendulum of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2m\"></span> and length <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8L\"></span>? </p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{f}{\\sqrt{8}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{f}{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2f\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{8}f\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
